This game is an accurate representation of The Backrooms series by K. Pixels. You can explore different liminal areas, roleplay in different teams, and uncover horrors beyond your comprehension.

Credits: @vojnik_23 - Main Builder and Scripter
@irondama - Help with scripting
@NIcki20050 - Help with building
@alisich8 - Some models and posters
@Stodja2 - Hazmat clothes
K. Pixels - The Backrooms series and various different songs used in-game
Ivan Beck - Founder of Async

All these rooms... misremembering themselves. It's beautiful, isn't it?

🦇 FEATURES:⬇

🦇Try on : Choose from a wide variety of outfits and try on the one you desire.

🦇Save Your Favorites: Found an avatar you love? Give it a like and it will be instantly saved to your Favorites list.

🦇Direct Inventory: Every purchase you make will be added directly to your official Roblox inventory.

IMPORTANT NOTES:
Some outfits were created by me; I do not claim that all outfits are mine or UGC. For removal requests, please contact me on Roblox


